pick them up tomorrow morning

Garage layout - no photos - the building engineer was on site this morning - he reviewed with Tom the scope of
the work - no layout to date - the metal scrap guy will be on island tomorrow to start disassembling the old/rotten
containers

Respectfully submitted,



